{"id":"73653f2b36e4ca9d","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-one-predicate-complexity.md","title":"Vardanyan Complexity in the One-Predicate Fragment","display":"thm-one-predicate-complexity — Vardanyan Complexity in the One-Predicate Fragment","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-one-predicate-complexity","aliases":["89-thm-one-predicate-complexity"],"display":"thm-one-predicate-complexity — Vardanyan Complexity in the One-Predicate Fragment","depends_on":["[[89-df-one-predicate-qml]]","[[89-df-qml-validity-sets]]","[[89-df-relative-completeness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-one-predicate-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-one-predicate-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-one-predicate-complexity — Vardanyan Complexity in the One-Predicate Fragment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7691d5ec76419b08\" href=\"?note=7691d5ec76419b08\" title=\"89-df-one-predicate-qml\">89-df-one-predicate-qml</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce269af4e544b5ee\" href=\"?note=ce269af4e544b5ee\" title=\"89-df-qml-validity-sets\">89-df-qml-validity-sets</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ced779f9ea9b74df\" href=\"?note=ced779f9ea9b74df\" title=\"89-df-relative-completeness\">89-df-relative-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AP}_{G,1}=\\mathrm{AP}_Q\\cap g_Q[\\mathrm{Sent}_{G,1}]\">\\(\\mathrm{AP}_{G,1}=\\mathrm{AP}_Q\\cap g_Q[\\mathrm{Sent}_{G,1}]\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AT}_{G,1}=\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\cap g_Q[\\mathrm{Sent}_{G,1}]\">\\(\\mathrm{AT}_{G,1}=\\mathrm{AT}_Q\\cap g_Q[\\mathrm{Sent}_{G,1}]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>标准 PA 可靠；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为算术真值码集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}one\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AP}_{G,1},\\Pi^0_2)\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AT}_{G,1},\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}one\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AP}_{G,1},\\Pi^0_2)\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{AT}_{G,1},\\Pi^0_1(\\mathcal V)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 18 章，印刷页 242–255；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\nVardanyan 的加强结果。上界由全语言结论及片段码可判定性继承；下界需要新的有效编码，不能仅由子集关系推出。原书通过一个一元谓词及不嵌套盒编码关系、算术模型和 oracle 计算，包含多条专门引理；此条引用该完整来源证明，未声称这些归约已经逐项机械化。片段的总可证集合仍不可递归公理化，总为真集合仍非算术。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-one-predicate-qml","status":"resolved","id":"7691d5ec76419b08","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-one-predicate-qml]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-qml-validity-sets","status":"resolved","id":"ce269af4e544b5ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-validity-sets]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-relative-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"ced779f9ea9b74df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnc